{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49901","headline":"菩萨蛮 · 耿玉真","name":"菩萨蛮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉京人去秋萧索，画檐鹊起梧桐落。\n欹枕悄无言，月和残梦圆。\n背灯唯暗泣甚处砧声急眉黛远山攒芭蕉生暮寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿玉真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}